  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.511 Faculty",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.511 “Faculty” means individuals that holds an EMS I or EMS I/C designation and are employed by an educational training agency that are responsible for the delivery of educational content. This term includes the term “instructional staff.”\n\nSource. #13953, eff 4-30-24",
